modplugplay by Fredrik Wikstrom.

----

Plays 22 different mod formats, including:
  MOD, S3M, XM, IT, 669, AMF (both of them), AMS, DBM, DMF, DSM, FAR,
  MDL, MED, MTM, OKT, PTM, STM, ULT, UMX, MT2, PSM

